<title>USA: Atlantic Coast Airlines January traffic up.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Coast Airlines January traffic up.</headline>
<dateline>DULLES, Va. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan  1997	  Jan   1996</p>
<p> Load factor - percent     37.0		38.5</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles   23.5		20.7</p>
<p> Available seat miles	63.4		53.6</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000,000s)</p>
<p>NOTES: Atlantic Coast Airlines Inc.</p>
<p>Jan revenue passenger miles increased 13.6 percent  over the year-earlier period.</p>
</text>
